  "details": "Hey, everyone, it's Daniil_KnyaZz.\n\nI want to suggest very big idea that is... \"I want to suggest Integration with Steam / Discord and Twitch\"\n\nAddition - Explanation\n\n<<We could have the possibility of merging Social media accounts with game itself.\nI suggest feature \"a user could clicks on small icons in VR Chat profile and it would connect VR Chat with person`s Steam / Discord / Twitch profile and then adding people in friends through that.\" (if they have suggested to show it)\nThis feature could possibly eliminate the problem of having to spend ages trying to find that specific person outside of the game and makes life that little bit better.\nAlso this helps eliminate the haste of tabbing out of game to add players in Steam / Discord / Twitch.>>\n\nAlso here is how i see this idea.",
